NAME
       cut - select fields or characters from each line

SYNOPSIS
       cut -f list [-d delim] [file...]
       cut -c list [file...]

DESCRIPTION
       Prints the selected parts of every input line. LIST is a
       comma-separated set of numbers and ranges, for example 1,3-5.

OPTIONS
       -f L   select fields
       -c L   select characters
       -d D   field delimiter (default is TAB)

EXAMPLES
       cut -d: -f1 /etc/passwd

SEE ALSO
       awk(1), tr(1), sed(1)
